                'num' => 1,
                'lines' => [
                    '"Man of sorrows," what a name for the Son of God, who came',
                    'ruined sinners to reclaim! Hallelujah! What a Savior!',
                ],
            ],
            [
                'label' => 'Verse 2',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 2,
                'lines' => [
                    'Bearing shame and scoffing rude, In my place condemned He stood; Sealed my',
